<title>ITALY: CYCLING - SWEDEN'S MAGNUSSON WINS 13TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING - SWEDEN'S MAGNUSSON WINS 13TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>CUNEO, Italy 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenn Magnusson of Sweden won the 145-km 13th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycling race on Friday, according to provisional results. </p>
<p>Mirko Rossato of Italy was second and his compatriot Mario Cipollini third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Pavel Tonkov of Russia retained the overall lead.</p>
